    {
      "id": "ydyp",
      "name": "移动云盘签到",
      "author": "@Feng",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/scripts/ydyp.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "移动云盘自动签到 v5.0.8：每日签到/戳一戳、云朵中心新版任务(上传/分享/AI相机/云笔记/开启通知)、算力大作战、红包派对、139邮箱任务，支持多账号",
        "抓取：打开移动云盘 App，① 进「云盘/文件」页抓 Authorization（personal-kd-njs.yun.139.com/hcy/ 或 mnote authTokenRefresh.do），② 进「活动 - 云朵中心」抓 deviceId（m.mcloud.139.com/market/signin/），抓取开关用完记得关闭",
        "ydyp_data 为 JSON 数组：[{\"Authorization\":\"Basic xxx\",\"phone\":\"138xxxxxxxx\",\"deviceId\":\"\"}]；deviceId 由抓取写入 ydyp_cache，也可抓包 startSignIn / receiveV2 / infoV3 请求头手动填写",
        "Authorization 由脚本按有效期自动刷新(AES-ECB 调 refreshToken)，刷新结果与 deviceId 缓存在 ydyp_cache，无需手动维护；CK 彻底失效时通知会列出失效账号",
        "算力大作战好友助力默认邀请码已在脚本内，按需在 TOKENPK_INVITE_CODE 修改"
      ],
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/icons/yidongyunpan.png",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jy0703/scripts/main/icons/yidongyunpan.png"
      ],
      "keys": [
        "ydyp_data",
        "ydyp_device_id",
        "ydyp_cache"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "ydyp_data",
          "name": "移动云盘数据",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "rows": 5,
          "placeholder": "",
          "desc": "抓包生成的账号数组，可按需补充 deviceId"
        },
        {
          "id": "ydyp_device_id",
          "name": "全局 deviceId",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "rows": 1,
          "placeholder": "",
          "desc": "可选，填写后所有账号优先使用；抓包 startSignIn / receiveV2 / infoV3 请求头 deviceId"
        },
        {
          "id": "ydyp_cache",
          "name": "deviceId/Token 缓存",
          "val": "",
          "type": "textarea",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "rows": 4,
          "placeholder": "",
          "desc": "脚本自维护(对应 py 的 ydyp_device_ids.json)，清空即可让账号重新生成 deviceId 与刷新 Token"
        }
      ]
    },
